    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Configuration for adaptive TTL based on table mutation rate.</para>
<para>Used with <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_schema_manager_1a00e070bf8920ad546ab13418fb76cad1" kindref="member">SchemaManager::enableAdaptiveTTL()</ref>. When adaptive TTL is enabled, the effective cache TTL is computed as: effective_ttl = clamp(base_ttl / (1 + scale_factor * rate), min_ttl, max_ttl) where rate = mutations per second observed within the measurement window. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
